NightBreath Mixed License
=========================

NightBreath / Bamsum is a mixed-license repository.

Unless a file, directory, or third-party notice states otherwise, NightBreath
source code, tests, local development tools, project-owned documentation, and
project-owned app assets are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The Apache License text is available in:

  LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt

Third-party datasets and third-party materials keep their upstream licenses.
They are not relicensed under Apache-2.0 by this repository.

ESC-50 Dataset
--------------

If this repository is distributed with `Datasets/ESC-50-master/**`, those files
remain third-party dataset content from the ESC-50 project.

The ESC-50 dataset as a whole is distributed by its upstream project under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 3.0 license. The ESC-10 subset is
distributed under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0.

NightBreath does not relicense ESC-50 or ESC-10 dataset files. The Apache
License, Version 2.0 does not apply to `Datasets/ESC-50-master/**`.

See:

  LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-3.0.txt
  LICENSES/CC-BY-3.0.txt
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

Commercial Use Notice
---------------------

Apache-2.0 applies only to the NightBreath-owned code and materials described
above. Any use of ESC-50 content must comply with the ESC-50 upstream license,
including the NonCommercial restriction for the full ESC-50 dataset.

Model and Dataset Outputs
-------------------------

Generated model files, evaluation outputs, personal samples, and local dataset
manifests may have separate provenance and licensing constraints. Do not treat
them as Apache-2.0 unless they are explicitly reviewed and marked as such.
